<view class="profile-edit-page">
  <view class="intro-card">
    <text class="intro-title">个人学业资料</text>
    <text class="intro-desc">这些信息将用于 AI 定位、个人档案和后续规划。当前只收集已经明确需要的最小字段。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card">
    <label class="field">
      <text class="field-label">本科院校</text>
      <input
        class="field-input"
        data-field="university"
        value="{{form.university}}"
        placeholder="例如：中南大学"
        bindinput="onFieldInput"
      />
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <text class="field-label">专业方向</text>
      <input
        class="field-input"
        data-field="major"
        value="{{form.major}}"
        placeholder="例如：人工智能"
        bindinput="onFieldInput"
      />
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <text class="field-label">当前年级</text>
      <input
        class="field-input"
        data-field="currentGrade"
        value="{{form.currentGrade}}"
        placeholder="例如：大二"
        bindinput="onFieldInput"
      />
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <text class="field-label">绩点 / 均分</text>
      <input
        class="field-input"
        data-field="gpaText"
        value="{{form.gpaText}}"
        placeholder="例如：GPA 3.72 / 4.0"
        bindinput="onFieldInput"
      />
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <text class="field-label">专业排名</text>
      <input
        class="field-input"
        data-field="rankText"
        value="{{form.rankText}}"
        placeholder="例如：12 / 103"
        bindinput="onFieldInput"
      />
    </label>
  </view>

  <button
    class="save-button"
    loading="{{saving}}"
    disabled="{{saving || loading}}"
    bindtap="onSave"
  >
    保存资料
  </button>

  <text class="privacy-note">后续新增资料字段时，应继续遵循“业务需要再收集”的原则，不把无关个人信息塞进档案。</text>
</view>
